          "snippet": {
            "line": 650,
            "text": "theorem nativeSource_mass (e : ℕ) {q : E → ℝ} (hq : ∀ p, 0 < q p)\n    (F : ℝ × E → ℝ) (p : E) :\n    mass e (nativeSource q F) p = mass e F p / lengthScale q p ^ (e + 1)"
